2851416809619663</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/07/monday-assorted-links-567.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-567">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/kingofthecoastt/status/2072851416809619663</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/kingofthecoastt/status/2072851416809619663</guid><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 15:49:36 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[The world’s first fully robot-run hotel in China?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://tech.yahoo.com/general/articles/world-first-fully-robot-run-184455211.html?utm_source=getsuperintel.site&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=meta-s-watermelon-llm-catches-gpt-5-5&_bhlid=7157d1d4df4a2f0e701ff920a9a2494938d1aab9">https://tech.yahoo.com/general/articles/world-first-fully-robot-run-184455211.html?utm_source=getsuperintel.site&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=meta-s-watermelon-llm-catches-gpt-5-5&_bhlid=7157d1d4df4a2f0e701ff920a9a2494938d1aab9</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/07/monday-assorted-links-567.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-567">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://tech.yahoo.com/general/articles/world-first-fully-robot-run-184455211.html?utm_source=getsuperintel.site&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=meta-s-watermelon-llm-catches-gpt-5-5&amp;_bhlid=7157d1d4df4a2f0e701ff920a9a2494938d1aab9</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://tech.yahoo.com/general/articles/world-first-fully-robot-run-184455211.html?utm_source=getsuperintel.site&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=meta-s-watermelon-llm-catches-gpt-5-5&amp;_bhlid=7157d1d4df4a2f0e701ff920a9a2494938d1aab9</guid><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 15:49:36 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Will the UK run out of air conditioning units?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://w